fixture pogo_held_press_never_charges
doc Movement review 6, H1; docs/adr/0013 The Charged strike: a hold whose press started a down-strike (or an up-strike) never arms the Charged strike. A down-strike pressed early and held 27 f whiffs; let go on 27 and pressed again on 28, the second press pogoes the spikes on 32. Before the fix the release fired a Charged strike in the air on 27 that refused the pogo press, and Ash fell into the spikes on 33.
room test/spikes
spawn 600 60
frames 40
input
  0..26 D attack
  27 D
  28..34 D attack
end
expect
  at 0 action=down
  at 26 charge_held=0
  never 0..39 event.charge_release=1
  never 0..39 event.charge_ready=1
  at 28 action=down
  at 32 event.pogo=1
  never 25..39 event.hazard=1
end
